@page "/components/page"

<PageTitle>Page</PageTitle>

<h1>Page <ComponentBadges Tag="wa-page" /></h1>
<p><code>&lt;wa-page&gt;</code> wrapped by <code>WaPage</code>.</p>
<p>
    <code>WaPage</code> is designed to be the root layout of an application, offering slots for a banner, header,
    navigation, main content, and footer. The examples below show scaled-down pages embedded in fixed-height
    containers; in a real application the component would wrap the entire page content.
</p>

<ExampleSection Title="Default" Code="@DefaultExample">
    <div style="height: 320px; border: 1px solid var(--wa-color-surface-border); overflow: auto;">
        <WaPage MobileBreakpoint="0">
            <Header>
                <div style="padding: var(--wa-space-s); background: var(--wa-color-neutral-fill-quiet);">Header</div>
            </Header>
            <Navigation>
                <div style="padding: var(--wa-space-s);">Navigation</div>
            </Navigation>
            <ChildContent>
                <div style="padding: var(--wa-space-s);">Main content</div>
            </ChildContent>
            <Footer>
                <div style="padding: var(--wa-space-s); background: var(--wa-color-neutral-fill-quiet);">Footer</div>
            </Footer>
        </WaPage>
    </div>
</ExampleSection>

<ExampleSection Title="Navigation at the End" Code="@EndExample">
    <div style="height: 240px; border: 1px solid var(--wa-color-surface-border); overflow: auto;">
        <WaPage MobileBreakpoint="0" NavigationPlacement="WaPageNavigationPlacement.End">
            <Header><div style="padding: var(--wa-space-s); background: var(--wa-color-neutral-fill-quiet);">Header</div></Header>
            <Navigation><div style="padding: var(--wa-space-s);">Navigation on the end side</div></Navigation>
            <ChildContent><div style="padding: var(--wa-space-s);">Main content</div></ChildContent>
        </WaPage>
    </div>
</ExampleSection>

<ExampleSection Title="Aside, Menu and Main Header" Code="@RegionsExample">
    <div style="height: 280px; border: 1px solid var(--wa-color-surface-border); overflow: auto;">
        <WaPage MobileBreakpoint="0" NavigationPlacement="WaPageNavigationPlacement.Start">
            <Banner><div style="padding: var(--wa-space-2xs) var(--wa-space-s); background: var(--wa-color-brand-fill-quiet);">Banner: scheduled maintenance tonight</div></Banner>
            <Menu><div style="padding: var(--wa-space-s);">Menu</div></Menu>
            <MainHeader><div style="padding: var(--wa-space-s);"><strong>Dashboard</strong></div></MainHeader>
            <ChildContent><div style="padding: var(--wa-space-s);">Main content</div></ChildContent>
            <Aside><div style="padding: var(--wa-space-s);">Aside</div></Aside>
            <MainFooter><div style="padding: var(--wa-space-s);">Main footer</div></MainFooter>
        </WaPage>
    </div>
</ExampleSection>

<ExampleSection Title="Mobile View" Code="@MobileExample">
    <p>The page switches to its mobile view below <code>MobileBreakpoint</code>; <code>View</code> reports the view the element picked, and here it is forced by a very large breakpoint. The toggle in the header opens the navigation drawer.</p>
    <div style="height: 280px; border: 1px solid var(--wa-color-surface-border); overflow: auto;">
        <WaPage MobileBreakpoint="10000" View="WaPageView.Mobile" NavOpen="false" DisableNavigationToggle="false">
            <Header><div style="padding: var(--wa-space-s); background: var(--wa-color-neutral-fill-quiet);">Header</div></Header>
            <Navigation><div style="padding: var(--wa-space-s);">Navigation drawer</div></Navigation>
            <ChildContent><div style="padding: var(--wa-space-s);">Main content</div></ChildContent>
        </WaPage>
    </div>
</ExampleSection>

<ExampleSection Title="Desktop View Without a Navigation Toggle" Code="@DesktopExample">
    <div style="height: 200px; border: 1px solid var(--wa-color-surface-border); overflow: auto;">
        <WaPage MobileBreakpoint="0" View="WaPageView.Desktop" DisableNavigationToggle="true">
            <Header><div style="padding: var(--wa-space-s); background: var(--wa-color-neutral-fill-quiet);">Header</div></Header>
            <Navigation><div style="padding: var(--wa-space-s);">Always visible navigation</div></Navigation>
            <ChildContent><div style="padding: var(--wa-space-s);">Main content</div></ChildContent>
        </WaPage>
    </div>
</ExampleSection>

<ApiTable Tag="wa-page" />

